==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Black & White|Darmanitan|25}} from the {{TCG|Black & White}} expansion.
*'''Heat Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Latias Half Deck|Latias|4}} from the {{TCG|EX Trainer Kit}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

